    "body": "Problem:\r\nAs of #40321 there is now no mapping for `:restart`.\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\nZR performs `:restart`. Adding a count can perform `:restart!` or `:restart! +qall!`\r\n\r\nCloses #40497",
